  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">명퇴하고 기간제</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">강사로 학생들과 줄곧 동반하였는데요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이번에 인연이 된 아이들은 씩씩한 남자 중학교 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학년입니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. 2015 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개정 교육과정의 마지막 학년</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자유 낙하하는 물체의 운동에 나오는</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, ‘</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">중력의 크기 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">= 9.8 × </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">질량</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">’</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그동안 용수철저울과 추를 활용하였는데</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">힘 센서</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">힘 측정기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">가 있어 더 편리하게 수업하였습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">500g(0.5kg) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">추를 달면</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">약 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4.9N</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1,000g(1kg) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">추는 약 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">9.8N</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f1928f65d9035477331947578a1777dd9974b19\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f1928f65d9035477331947578a1777dd9974b19\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca6fc545bd21f6015066cc2d04717647dddfd2a1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca6fc545bd21f6015066cc2d04717647dddfd2a1\" data-origin-width=\"62\" data-origin-height=\"172\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68fe679ae8c754dd259597ddff38dc9b296b1a3e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68fe679ae8c754dd259597ddff38dc9b296b1a3e\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">스스로 교실 책상 고리를 찾아 기기를&#160; 거는 센스 넘치는 학생들!<br><br></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">힘 센서와 추를 내어주고 몇 분 지나지 않았는데</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;학생들이 고개를 끄덕이더군요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2022 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개정교육 과정에는 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학년부터 힘 센서를 사용하도록 소개되어 있네요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}